        "beat_id": "beat-4",
        "scene_id": "scene-03",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "What most viewers overlook next is this: look at the 4.3-micron peak. That's carbon dioxide. If you see that spike, you know the.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
        "entities": [],
